<h1 class="mb-4">Visiting the workshop</h1>

<div class="row g-4">
  <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
    <h2 class="h5">Where we are</h2>
    <p>Av. vitacura 555, Santiago.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">When we are open</h2>
    <ul class="list-unstyled">
      <li>Monday to Friday — 9:00 to 18:00</li>
      <li>Saturday — 10:00 to 14:00</li>
      <li>Sunday — closed</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
    <h2 class="h5">What happens when you bring a bike in</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>We write down your name and phone, and what the bike is.</li>
      <li>We photograph it as it arrives, so nobody argues later about a scratch.</li>
      <li>A mechanic looks at it and works out what it needs.</li>
      <li>If it is more than a quick job, we phone you with the price.</li>
      <li>Nothing is done until you say yes. If you say no, you collect it as it arrived.</li>
      <li>We give you a day, and we try to keep it.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>